  "description": "A command-line package manager for Minecraft mods hosted on CurseForge, facilitating automated search, installation, and dependency tracking via the CurseForge API. It maintains a local database to manage mod versions, hold update statuses, and resolve mod slugs to internal MODIDs, supporting specific Minecraft versions and mod loaders like Forge and Fabric.",
